  "details": "Ever since SDK3 came out for avatars when using the default locomotion layer and combining that with jumping and anything related to the action layer, it would cause the avatar to break the animation and would let the animation play, but it merges the proxy animations for crouching and proning with the animation or dance. Many users have made dedicated locomotion layers to potentially eliminate the problem but it would be nice to have this fixed for those that want to just slap on some new dances on an avatar",
